    <bpmn:process id="W_W2218" name="W2218. Dynamic Pricing Rule Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly rule review
Frequency: Monthly; ~50–100 active rules
Volume: ~50–100 rules
Owner: Pricing Analyst
Participants: Category Manager
Source: workflow W2218 — Dynamic Pricing Rule Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2218_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2218_Lane1" name="Pricing Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2218_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2218_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2218_End5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2218_Start3" name="Monthly rule review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2218_Flow8</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2218_Task4" name="Pricing Analyst maintains the dynamic-pricing rules: competitor-price-follow…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Pricing Analyst maintains the dynamic-pricing rules: competitor-price-follow rules (auto-adjust within a band), inventory-clearance rules (auto-markdown at threshold), time-based rules (happy-hour, slow-day); reviews rule performance and tunes
Responsible (R): Pricing Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 4–6 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2218_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2218_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2218_End5" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2218_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2218_Annotation6">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-400 (ensure controlled execution — Competitor Price Data Collection &amp; Analysis (PA-57.1).) | - CTL-400 (price-change authorization — links to VS-08); CTL-108 (margin-floor guard — loss-making price prevention); operational: Category Manager monthly rule-review sign-off
Owner: Pricing Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2218_Assoc7" sourceRef="W2218_Annotation6" targetRef="W2218_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
